id=pico4-steamlink-velfix
name=Pico 4 Steam Link Head-Velocity Fix
version=v1.2
versionCode=102
author=UbootVRC
description=Fixes the Steam Link head wobble on Pico 4 by replacing the forwarded head linear velocity with a position-derived one, and corrects the eye-gaze position used for foveation on headsets with eye tracking. Works on official Steam Link, no APK patch. Scoped to Steam Link only. Needs Zygisk. Tune via /data/local/tmp/pico4velfix-corr "mode window_ms gaze" (default 1 35 1).
